<title>USA: Inacom acquires two businesses.</title>
<headline>Inacom acquires two businesses.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inacom Corp said Wednesday it acquired Bethco Inc, an Atlanta-based computer hardware reseller, and the computer rental business of Catalink Direct Inc of Bristol, Pennsylvania.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Bethco has annual revenues of about $120 million, technology management services company Inacom said.</p>
<p>Inacom shares rose one to 26-5/8 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
